1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一条鱼，靠一把酸菜出了名
One fish — made famous by its pickles

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
连锁店招牌都写:酸菜比鱼好吃
The chains' slogan: "the pickle beats the fish"

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
鱼片切薄，蛋清抓一抓
Slice thin, massage with egg white

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
泡菜坛里的老酸菜先炒香
Old sour cabbage stir-fried till fragrant

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
泡姜、泡椒、花椒下锅
Pickled ginger, chili, peppercorns follow

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
一锅酸辣汤,滚着下鱼片
Fish slides into the bubbling sour-spicy broth

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
起源长江江津段的渔家
Born among fishermen on the Jiangjin Yangtze

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
打来的鱼，配船上泡菜一锅煮
Their catch, cooked with the boat's own pickles

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
90年代火遍全国的江湖菜
The "jianghu dish" that swept 1990s China

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
如今一个品牌就开出近500家
One chain alone now runs nearly 500 shops

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,400
松鼠桂鱼、剁椒、水煮、酸菜鱼
Squirrel, chili, boiled, pickled —

12
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,200
四种吃法，你站哪一碗？评论区见
four ways with one fish. Which is yours?
